---
import MainLayout from '../../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
import CollectionHeader from '../../components/ui/CollectionHeader.astro';
---
<MainLayout title="About the service directory" description="How service information, update dates and provider confirmations are presented.">
  <CollectionHeader title="About the service directory" description="Understanding the information on a service listing." breadcrumbs={[{ label: 'Home', href: '/' }, { label: 'Services', href: '/services' }, { label: 'About the directory' }]} />
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 py-10 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <article class="prose prose-slate max-w-3xl prose-a:text-primary-800">
      <h2>A community directory</h2>
      <p>Dzaleka Online Services brings together information about organisations and services. The organisations listed run their own services. A listing does not guarantee availability or eligibility.</p>
      <h2>Access information</h2>
      <p>Some listings include who can use a service, costs, required documents, appointments, languages and access arrangements. These details appear when they have been supplied. A missing field does not mean that a service is free, requires no documents or offers a particular language.</p>
      <h2>Updated and confirmed mean different things</h2>
      <p><strong>Listing updated</strong> records an edit to the listing. It is not a check by the provider.</p>
      <p><strong>Provider confirmation</strong> records who confirmed the details and when. A source link appears where one is available. Confirmations more than 180 days old are labelled so readers can see that the information may have changed.</p>
      <p>If no provider confirmation date is recorded, the page says so. Older “verified” labels alone do not count as a dated confirmation.</p>
      <h2>Send a correction</h2>
      <p>Use <a href="/services/update-request">the service update form</a> to provide corrected details and a source where possible. Updates are submitted for review. To add an organisation, use <a href="/services/register">service registration</a>.</p>
    </article>
  </div>
</MainLayout>
